source: crates/nb-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: help
---
notability audio — Recordings and transcripts

Usage: notability audio <command>

Commands:
  delete      Delete a recording
  list        Recordings on a note
  live        Live transcription: stream audio and get the transcript and smart notes
  record      Record audio on this machine with ffmpeg and attach it to a note
  transcript  Transcript text (--timestamps)
  upload      Attach an audio file to a note as a recording

Global Options:
  --filter-output <keys>              Filter output by key paths (e.g. foo,bar.baz,a[0,3])
  --format <toon|json|yaml|md|jsonl>  Output format
  --full-output                       Show full output envelope
  --help                              Show help
  --llms, --llms-full                 Print LLM-readable manifest
  --schema                            Show JSON Schema for command
  --token-count                       Print token count of output (instead of output)
  --token-limit <n>                   Limit output to n tokens
  --token-offset <n>                  Skip first n tokens of output
